    "detailed_description": "Adventure through a whimsical fantasy world, assemble a party of quirky characters you meet along the way, and fight monsters in turn based tactical combat! Set between the &quot;real&quot; world and the fantastical dreams of a young girl, you must help save the king in her dreamland- and maybe help to save her ill father, too.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/642fe24f675696aa190c2a0892a2045a.avif?t=1677099515\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/198f75df5e403628013b5424029484d5.poster.avif?t=1677099515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/198f75df5e403628013b5424029484d5.webm?t=1677099515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/198f75df5e403628013b5424029484d5.mp4?t=1677099515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore between the real world and the fantastical dream lands of Chimerada as Jane, a young girl that frequently gets lost in her own dream world. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/acb5f954021720daf11d11807d29d98d.avif?t=1677099515\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/6a2daa35d8ce2819320254225bddcf0c.poster.avif?t=1677099515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/6a2daa35d8ce2819320254225bddcf0c.webm?t=1677099515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/6a2daa35d8ce2819320254225bddcf0c.mp4?t=1677099515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Journey through the lands of Chimerada to search for a cure to the king's mysterious disease, and find friends to join you along the way!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/787f027f0b5bf3e7933edf1a0a733663.avif?t=1677099515\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/a2b914b565edd7422b5d932cf1cf33be.poster.avif?t=1677099515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/a2b914b565edd7422b5d932cf1cf33be.webm?t=1677099515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866360/extras/a2b914b565edd7422b5d932cf1cf33be.mp4?t=1677099515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Assemble a party of quirky characters and fight the monsters of Chimerada to get through the lands safely!<br><br>FEATURES:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy a hand crafted pixel art world with all-original art.<br></li><li>Explore between two towns- a quaint suburban town and a bustling fantasy city, Chimerada!<br></li><li>Explore eight different lands that surround the city of Chimerada!<br></li><li>Search for the objects of the Ancients to gather the power to save the king!<br></li><li>Run into enemies as you explore the lands of Chimerada to enter battles!<br></li><li>Play through dozens of unique tactics based battles! </li></ul>",
